      "guid": "com.tetris.dehazardifier",
      "name": "DeHazardifier - Updated by Tetris",
      "slug": "dehazardifier-updated-by-tetris",
      "teaser": "Dislike being sniped because you walked into an open area sniper zone on streets? Hate randomly blowing up because invisible 'minefields'? Think the claymores on streets are a pain in the ass and hard to see? Do you hate being stung by barbed wire?",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2813.png",
      "downloads": 23367,
      "favourites_count": 41,
      "description": "<p><strong>Original Mod by Tyrian</strong>: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1563-de-hazardifier/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">De-Hazardifier</a></p>\n<p>Additional thanks to CJ for maintaining up until now.</p>\n<p><strong>How to Use - Everything is within the F12 Bepinex menu.</strong></p>\n<p>The de-hazardifier enabler must be enabled before going into a raid, it won’t gather the visual objects of the claymores and barbed wire if it’s not enabled upon map start.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Sniper Zone Removal:</strong> Removes the auto-kill sniper boxes around extracts on maps like streets.</li>\n<li><strong>Minefield Zone Removal:</strong> Removes the auto-kill minefield zones around on certain maps like lighthouse, woods, etc.</li>\n<li><strong>Claymore Removal (Included Visual remover):</strong> Remove the physical claymores/directional mines on maps like streets, etc.</li>\n<li><strong>Barbed Wire Removal (Included Visual remover):</strong> Remove the physical barbed wire hazards.</li>\n<li><strong>Fire Damage Removal:</strong> Removes the damage taken while standing in fire hazards.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For any Issues, please leave a Comment, Create an Issue on the Github or message me via Discord: tetris</p>\n",
